{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104374","id":2404369357,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6PT8PN","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104374","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104374.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104374.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104374","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104374/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104374/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104374/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3eb4e6c6ff5a89ec06b3321e79e998dc4e680f3d","number":104374,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Optimize `Array` methods with `SWAP`/`std::move`","user":{"login":"aaronp64","id":136198872,"node_id":"U_kgDOCB462A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136198872?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronp64","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Updated `Array::shuffle()` to use `SWAP` instead of copying through temporary variables, which makes shuffling simple types around 2x faster, and refcounted object types around 20x faster.\r\n\r\nAlso updated multiple methods that insert into/modify the array to move their validated `Variant` to avoid an extra copy, speed increase varies depending on type and how much else the methods are doing, usually around 5-10% faster.\r\n\r\nCompared with gdscript below:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tshuffle_int()\r\n\tshuffle_obj()\r\n\tinsert_obj()\r\n\tpush_string()\r\n\tset_index_int()\r\n\tset_index_str()\r\n\tset_obj()\r\n\tfill_str()\r\n\r\nfunc shuffle_int():\r\n\tvar a := range(1000000)\r\n\tvar start := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\ta.shuffle()\r\n\tvar end := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tprint(\"shuffle_int: %dms\" % [end - start])\r\n\r\nfunc shuffle_obj():\r\n\tvar a := []\r\n\tfor i in 1000000:\r\n\t\ta.push_back(TestClass.new())\r\n\t\t\r\n\tvar start := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\ta.shuffle()\r\n\tvar end := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tprint(\"shuffle_obj: %dms\" % [end - start])\r\n\r\nfunc insert_obj():\r\n\tvar src := range(25000).map(func(i): return TestClass.new())\r\n\tvar a := []\r\n\tvar start := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tfor i in src.size():\r\n\t\ta.insert(i / 2, src[i])\r\n\tvar end := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tprint(\"insert_obj: %dms\" % [end - start])\r\n\r\nfunc push_string():\r\n\tvar src := range(1000000).map(str)\r\n\tvar a := []\r\n\tvar start := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tfor i in src.size():\r\n\t\ta.push_back(src[i])\r\n\tvar end := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tprint(\"push_string: %dms\" % [end - start])\r\n\r\nfunc set_index_int():\r\n\tvar src := range(1000000)\r\n\tvar dst := []\r\n\tdst.resize(src.size())\r\n\tvar start := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tfor i in src.size():\r\n\t\tdst[i] = src[i]\r\n\tvar end := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tprint(\"set_index_int: %dms\" % [end - start])\r\n\r\nfunc set_index_str():\r\n\tvar src := range(1000000).map(str)\r\n\tvar dst := []\r\n\tdst.resize(src.size())\r\n\tvar start := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tfor i in src.size():\r\n\t\tdst[i] = src[i]\r\n\tvar end := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tprint(\"set_index_str: %dms\" % [end - start])\r\n\t\r\nfunc set_obj():\r\n\tvar src := range(1000000).map(func(i): return TestClass.new())\r\n\tvar dst := []\r\n\tdst.resize(src.size())\r\n\tvar start := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tfor i in src.size():\r\n\t\tdst.set(i, src.get(i))\r\n\tvar end := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tprint(\"set_obj: %dms\" % [end - start])\r\n\r\nfunc fill_str():\r\n\tvar a := []\r\n\ta.resize(5)\r\n\tvar start := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tfor i in 1000000:\r\n\t\ta.fill(str(i))\r\n\tvar end := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tprint(\"fill_str: %dms\" % [end - start])\r\n\t\r\nclass TestClass:\r\n\tvar i : int\r\n\tvar f : float\r\n\tvar s : String\r\n```\r\n\r\nOld:\r\n```\r\nshuffle_int: 24ms\r\nshuffle_obj: 303ms\r\ninsert_obj: 158ms\r\npush_string: 184ms\r\nset_index_int: 57ms\r\nset_index_str: 97ms\r\nset_obj: 289ms\r\nfill_str: 442ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nNew:\r\n```\r\nshuffle_int: 14ms\r\nshuffle_obj: 14ms\r\ninsert_obj: 143ms\r\npush_string: 160ms\r\nset_index_int: 51ms\r\nset_index_str: 80ms\r\nset_obj: 250ms\r\nfill_str: 419ms\r\n```\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at